      "text": "The detailed instructions for the preparation and routing of these forms, as they appear on the printed form, are modified as follows: the original report will be referred to Victor F. Condello, DeWitt Clinton Hotel, Albany, N. Y.; a duplicate copy of the report shall be referred to Warren Moscow, Assistant to the Mayor at City Hall.",
